{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1508101-what-does-the-future-hold","id":1508101,"title":"What does the future hold?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-04-11T18:37:01-07:00","id":1508101,"title":"What does the future hold?","content":"In Adventure we were introduced to the early forms of the inspired that would evolve into Psiads and Novas, but we still haven't seen the evolution of the Talent as the Daredevil is still a inspiration powered Talent. So the real question is, if we've seen what became of the possible potential of those tapped into the Quantum and Sub-Quantum, what lies in the future of those who use Flux?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1435-videopete","name":"videopete","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1435_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"111"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-11T19:46:38-07:00","id":1508109,"title":"","content":"Your assumption is that psiads and novas are somehow &quot;evolved&quot; versus mesmerists and stalwarts, and this isn't really true. Mesmerists and stalwarts are the way they are because the Doyen blanketed the Earth in an effect which suppressed the growth of psi and quantum powers.<br /> <br /> As for the future of flux powers, presumably something akin to magogs, but without the Deviations.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi","name":"Shepherdboi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25506_1.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-12T01:14:08-07:00","id":1508126,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>videopete</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1508101-what-does-the-future-hold#post1508101\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In Adventure we were introduced to the early forms of the inspired that would evolve into Psiads and Novas, but we still haven't seen the evolution of the Talent as the Daredevil is still a inspiration powered Talent. So the real question is, if we've seen what became of the possible potential of those tapped into the Quantum and Sub-Quantum, what lies in the future of those who use Flux?</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shepherdboi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1508101-what-does-the-future-hold?p=1508109#post1508109\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Your assumption is that psiads and novas are somehow &quot;evolved&quot; versus mesmerists and stalwarts, and this isn't really true. Mesmerists and stalwarts are the way they are because the Doyen blanketed the Earth in an effect which suppressed the growth of psi and quantum powers.<br /> <br /> As for the future of flux powers, presumably something akin to magogs, but without the Deviations.</div> </div> </div> </div>I disagree. Magogs are the result of Aether, which is a byproduct of the interaction between Quantum and Flux; it is <i>not</i> the future of those who use Flux. In particular, Magogs are more akin to Novas than they are to Talents: they're all about boosting raw physical capacity to inhuman levels. As a \u201cfuture of Flux users\u201d, it's singularly unimaginative: \u201clet's make enhanced Flux users just like Novas\u201d. <br /> <br /> Instead, the future of those who use Flux is more along the lines of <b>Assassins</b>: a shift away from subconscious manipulations expressing themselves as lucky breaks and towards more intentional expressions of competence, to the extent that the competence can reach absurd and even impossible levels:<div style=\"margin-left:40px\">Masteries are special abilities that an Assassin learns as tools of her craft. An Assassin doesn't just bend the likelihoods and probabilities around her, she cows them to her whim and breaks them. \u2026 Like Talents, she uses her Inspiration to do this, drawing on the Flux of the Continuum, but unlike Talents, an Assassin has control over her use. This is a deliberate act, one that would appear in Daylight as a fantastic display of unbelievable magnitude\u2026<br /> <br /> <b>TC: Assassins</b> p.127. </div> <br /> \u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200bMore generally, I would say that \u201cevolved Talents\u201d would tend to bear a not inconsiderable resemblance to <b>Exalted</b>. Which isn't surprising, because both <b>Assassins</b> and <b>Exalted</b> draw inspiration from wuxia. <br /> <br /> And to the extent that they start developing outright powers, as opposed to impossible feats of skill, I expect those powers to be related to space and time: teleportation, \u201cstepping sideways\u201d into the Mists, conjuring items to them or banishing opponents to other times, places, or worlds, creating portals; maybe even distorting distances or durations or manipulating gravity. That sort of thing. <br /> <br /> But physical mutations that lead to the body doing inhuman things, a la Magogs? That's what <i>Quantum</i> does; not Flux.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-12T04:46:37-07:00","id":1508137,"title":"","content":"I guess the use of Flux Assassins and Polyphemus have show us that Flux is amazingly versatile on the directions it can go.<br /> <br /> My guess is next tier Flux users have strong connections to all Dimensions (Time, Space and Cross-Time), so seeing the future, traveling to other dimensions, teleportation, distorting space, distorting time, accessing the knowledge of their other-selves, bringing the physical traits of their other selves, changing characteristics of objects to what it could have been, etc etc.<br /> <br /> They probably can do other things, same way a Psi user can alter their body properties to a limited extension, while the Quantum user is the true master of their body, a Flux user probably can do other things that at first are not obvious linked to Flux, much like an assassin can cut a wall to reach the target, or a talent can come back from death, I would say the possibilities are infinite but at a limited power.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-12T04:48:53-07:00","id":1508138,"title":"","content":"Another possible evolution of the Talents that would make sense to me is what you can see in the movie &quot;Everything, Everywhere, All at Once&quot;, only without the need of tech. These talents would have the ability to contact any of their alternative selves and borrow their skills. Just imagine a person who has the power to be amazing at everything, to have any or even all skills at five dots.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2964-firanai","name":"Firanai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2964_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-12T05:40:30-07:00","id":1508143,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1508101-what-does-the-future-hold?p=1508126#post1508126\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b<br /> I disagree. Magogs are the result of Aether, which is a byproduct of the interaction between Quantum and Flux; it is <i>not</i> the future of those who use Flux. In particular, Magogs are more akin to Novas than they are to Talents: they're all about boosting raw physical capacity to inhuman levels. As a \u201cfuture of Flux users\u201d, it's singularly unimaginative: \u201clet's make enhanced Flux users just like Novas\u201d.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not really. The vast amounts of Aether present during the Victorian era is a result of &quot;Martian&quot; Q-tech blasting through the dimensional barriers, but Aether is generated in tiny amounts without any quantum interaction. Aether is 100% not Quantum+Flux, as specifically noted in the setting secrets chapter.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Firanai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1508101-what-does-the-future-hold?p=1508138#post1508138\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Another possible evolution of the Talents that would make sense to me is what you can see in the movie &quot;Everything, Everywhere, All at Once&quot;, only without the need of tech. These talents would have the ability to contact any of their alternative selves and borrow their skills. Just imagine a person who has the power to be amazing at everything, to have any or even all skills at five dots.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bI believe that Gift already exists. I don't have time to check since I leave for work in ten minutes, but I specifically recall a Gift that lets you replace a Skill with another Skill for a scene due to the existence of dimensional doubles.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi","name":"Shepherdboi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25506_1.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-12T05:58:26-07:00","id":1508145,"title":"","content":"My interpretation of Aether, as I understood from the book, is that it\u2019s not PURE flux, it\u2019s Flux forced out of its natural state with external source of energy, that is Quantum for the Aether era. The amount of Aether during that period is due the Martian attacks, but it can be made in smaller amounts using other methods, and people have been doing it for years.<br /> <br /> It doesn\u2019t mean Aether is Flux, it is mostly Flux, but not the natural Flux. So what Magogs can do is MOSTLY what is possible to do with Flux, but as it\u2019s not in it\u2019s natural state, I would say they can do what they do in the scale they do due to the large amount of Aether available in the time, while they would be largely limited if they had a normal level of flux.<br /> <br /> So, Gogs and Magogs are flux users, but they are not really a talent next step, they are what you can become for overplaying with Flux.<br /> <br /> To complete my point, a Nova the way they are in Aberrant is not the natural evolution of quantum users, but a forced version of it. Probably natural Novas would be closer to what Mal is in Adventure Era, less prone to mutations.<br /> <br /> <br /> Edit: From the manuscript of players guide:<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Aether is not the same as flux, yet this period is another obstacle to be surmounted by those who would travel past it in time. Rifts to this era may open into the labs of Aethernaut geniuses, leaving the characters stumbling out of glowing green portals. Also, the differences between Aether and flux can cause time travel using Aether \u2014 or even taking place too close to a significant concentration of Aether \u2014 to operate in unexpected and problematic ways, risking stranding the time travelers in the past. This era is covered in detail in Trinity Continuum: Aether. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":24985,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","user":"Mateus Luz","date":". 04-12-2023, 09:29 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-12T16:09:26-07:00","id":1508206,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shepherdboi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1508101-what-does-the-future-hold?p=1508143#post1508143\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not really. The vast amounts of Aether present during the Victorian era is a result of &quot;Martian&quot; Q-tech blasting through the dimensional barriers, but Aether is generated in tiny amounts without any quantum interaction. Aether is 100% not Quantum+Flux, as specifically noted in the setting secrets chapter.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not saying it is. I'm saying that it exists in quantities that matter because of Quantum technology tunneling through dimensional barriers. Once the Martian threat was neutralized, Aether all but disappeared.<br /> <br /> But much more importantly, my point is that the essences of Magogs is the sort of thing one would expect from Quantum stuff; so the idea that Magogs represent what Flux users can become is essentially the same as saying that Flux users evolve into Novas. And that's lazy. \u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":421,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","user":"Dataweaver","date":". 04-12-2023, 08:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}